{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07716","headline":"田园作 · 孟浩然","name":"田园作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弊庐隔尘喧，惟先养恬素。\n卜邻近三径，植果盈千树。\n粤余任推迁，三十犹未遇。\n书劒时将晚，丘园日已暮。\n晨兴自多怀，昼坐常寡悟。\n冲天羡鸿鹄，争食羞鸡骛。\n望断金马门，劳歌采樵路。\n乡曲无知己，朝端乏亲故。\n谁能爲扬雄，一荐甘泉赋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}